diff --git a/CHANGES.rst b/CHANGES.rst
index 540bbe2..6379add 100644
--- a/CHANGES.rst
+++ b/CHANGES.rst
@@ -6,6 +6,11 @@ Version 8.2.0
 Unreleased
 
 -   Drop support for Python 3.7. :pr:`2588`
+-   Add ``cleanup_timeout`` parameter to :class:`Context` to limit the
+    duration of cleanup operations run by ``Context.close``.  Cleanup
+    that exceeds the timeout is abandoned with a warning instead of
+    hanging.  Shell completion closes its resolved context, respecting
+    the timeout.
 -   Use modern packaging metadata with ``pyproject.toml`` instead of ``setup.cfg``.
     :pr:`326`
 -   Use ``flit_core`` instead of ``setuptools`` as build backend.
